    { question: "Will there be diverse representation at the Oscars 2026?", answer: "The Academy has been making concerted efforts towards greater diversity and inclusion. Early reports, such as the focus on '12 Male Asian Celebrities That Stunned Us On The Oscars Red Carpet,' suggest a continued push for diverse representation across categories and public recognition." }
