    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic, high-resolution industry-specific visual depicting the Indian stock market. The foreground features a diverse group of investors (representing India, US, UK, Canada, Australia) looking intently at trading screens that display green upward arrows and red downward arrows, signifying volatility. In the background, subtle elements like a rising graph representing IPO growth, a symbolic Indian Rupee coin alongside a USD dollar coin, and a stylized handshake between two national leaders (representing Trump and Modi announcement, without depicting actual faces) are integrated. The overall composition should be vibrant, professional, and convey both the energy of a booming market and the tension of global trade impacts, with a clear focus on financial industry elements.",
