      neutralCase: "The crypto market is in a phase of significant maturation, where security challenges and geopolitical influences are becoming more pronounced. These events, while disruptive, are part of the evolutionary process, leading to a more resilient but also more complex investment landscape. The market will likely continue to experience periods of both rapid growth and significant corrections as it adapts to these challenges.",
      probabilityWeightedOutlook: "There\'s a moderate probability of continued market volatility driven by both internal security concerns and external geopolitical factors. The resolution of the Liquid Network incident and the outcome of Harmony\'s migration will be key short-term indicators. Long-term, the market is likely to trend upwards, but with enhanced scrutiny on project security and a greater awareness of macro risks. (60% Neutral, 25% Bearish, 15% Bullish in the short term, shifting to 50% Bullish, 30% Neutral, 20% Bearish in the long term with successful resolutions).",
