    featuredImagePrompt: "A dynamic editorial news layout featuring a split screen. On one side, a dark, turbulent storm cloud gathering over a downward-trending stock market chart, symbolizing worsening risk-reward. On the other side, a professional financial analyst (gender neutral) with a serious expression, looking at a digital screen displaying stock tickers and a VIX index chart, with the Citadel Securities logo subtly incorporated. The color palette should be muted, with strong contrasts between the stormy market and the focused analyst. Emphasize a sense of urgency and caution. Use deep blues, grays, and subtle reds for market downturns.",
