    outlook: "The future outlook for institutional crypto infrastructure appears robust, with BitGo\'s acquisition serving as a strong indicator of strategic growth. We anticipate further consolidation within the sector as firms seek scale and diversified offerings. The convergence of AI and crypto, as seen with Bullish and USD.AI, suggests new avenues for growth and innovation, particularly in structured finance products and data-driven trading strategies. Regulatory clarity, particularly in major financial hubs, will be crucial in sustaining this growth trajectory. Overall, the long-term trend points towards a more integrated, regulated, and institutionally-driven digital asset ecosystem.",
